      "source": "The following example uses the [`onChange(of:initial:_:)`](view/onchange(of:initial:_:)-8wgw9.md) method to enable a timer whenever the enclosing scene enters the [`ScenePhase.active`](scenephase/active.md) phase and disable the timer when entering any other phase:",
      "normalizedSource": "The following example uses the [`onChange(of:initial:_:)`](view/onchange(of:initial:_:)-8wgw9.md) method to enable a timer whenever the enclosing scene enters the [`ScenePhase.active`](scenephase/active.md) phase and disable the timer when entering any other phase:",
