      "contextBefore": "If you read the phase from inside a [`View`](view.md) instance, you obtain a value that reflects the phase of the scene that contains the view.",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nstruct MyView: View {\n    @ObservedObject var model: DataModel\n    @Environment(\\.scenePhase) private var scenePhase\n\n    var body: some View {\n        TimerView()\n            .onChange(of: scenePhase) {\n                model.isTimerRunning = (scenePhase == .active)\n            }\n    }\n}\n```",
